<li><strong>SOX-grade access controls.</strong> Our authorization framework, segregation-of-duties tagging, and approval-routing patterns matter more here than in a typical mid-market deal. Don't dilute them in MVP cuts.</li>
<li><strong>Reporting maturity expectations are public-company-ish.</strong> HUB's CFO is preparing for analyst calls. Variance analysis, accrual aging, producer-payable rollforwards — these aren't nice-to-haves; they're audit committee material.</li>
